        <mxCell id="cl_spa" value="&lt;b style='font-size:16px;color:#0F172A;'&gt;Racehorse Web App&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:11.5px;color:#64748B;'&gt;React 19 • Vite 8 • React Router 7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:10.5px;color:#334155;'&gt;Single-Page Web Application&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style='border:none;border-top:1px solid #E2E8F0;margin:6px 0;'/&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:10px;color:#475569;'&gt;• Deployed on Vercel Global Edge CDN&lt;br/&gt;• Recharts • Three.js 3D Track Visualizer&lt;br/&gt;• REST API Client via fetch &amp;amp; Bearer JWT&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=1.8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=12;fontColor=#0F172A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
